nerve signal. Every muscle ) Tj T* (that contracts and relaxes. Every cell producing energy. Every breath you take. Most of us) Tj T* ( will never notice these thousands of silent moments. Yet life depends on them. Perhaps th) Tj T* (at is one of the lessons magnesium quietly teaches us. The most important things in life a) Tj T* (re often the ones we rarely see.) Tj T* () Tj T* (A healthy heart.) Tj T* () Tj T* (A peaceful night?s sleep.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Strong bones.) Tj T* () Tj T* (A clear mind.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Faithful friendships.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Quiet acts of kindness.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The strongest foundations are usually hidden beneath the surface.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Knowledge Before Purchase) Tj T* () Tj T* (If you have reached the end of this guide, you may still decide not to buy a magnesium sup) Tj T* (plement. That is perfectly acceptable. Our purpose has never been to persuade you to purch) Tj T* (ase something. Our purpose has been to help you understand. Sometimes the best decision is) Tj T* ( to improve your diet. Sometimes it is to discuss supplementation with your healthcare pro) Tj T* (fessional. Sometimes it is to discover that a supplement is unnecessary. An informed decis) Tj T* (ion is always more valuable than an impulsive one.) Tj T* () Tj T* (A Word About Health) Tj T* () Tj T* (No supplement replaces the foundations of good health.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Nutritious food.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Regular movement.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Restorative sleep.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Managing stress.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Meaningful relationships.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Appropriate medical care.) Tj T* () Tj T* (These remain the cornerstones of well-being. Supplements can play a supporting role. They ) Tj T* (should never be expected to carry the whole weight.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The Humility of Science) Tj T* () Tj T* (One of the most encouraging aspects of science is that it continues asking questions. Rese) Tj T* (archers do not simply collect facts. They continually test them. Challenge them. Improve t) Tj T* (hem. Sometimes they confirm earlier findings. Sometimes they discover something entirely u) Tj T* (nexpected. That willingness to learn is not weakness. It is one of science?s greatest stre) Tj T* (ngths. As new evidence emerges, recommendations should evolve with it. This guide will do ) Tj T* (the same.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Our Commitment) Tj T* () Tj T* (Every TAFAT Evidence Guide is written with one simple commitment.) Tj T* () Tj T* (To explain what current evidence supports.) Tj T* () Tj T* (To acknowledge what remains uncertain.) Tj T* () Tj T* (To avoid exaggeration.) Tj T* () Tj T* (To respect your intelligence.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Trust is not built through impressive headlines.) Tj T* () Tj T* (It is built sentence by sentence. One honest explanation at a time.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Thank You) Tj T* () Tj T* (Thank you for giving us your time. We know it is one of the most valuable things you have.) Tj T* ( Whether you arrived here searching for better sleep, healthier muscles, answers about mig) Tj T* (raines, or simply trying to understand the many magnesium supplements on the shelf, we hop) Tj T* (e you leave with something more valuable than a recommendation. We hope you leave with con) Tj T* (fidence. Confidence to ask better questions. Confidence to read labels more carefully. Con) Tj T* (fidence to recognize the difference between evidence and advertising. Confidence to make d) Tj T* (ecisions that are right for you. If this guide has helped you do that, then it has fulfill) Tj T* (ed its purpose.) Tj T* () Tj T* (About TAFAT) Tj T* () Tj T* (Truth Before Commissions) Tj T* () Tj T* (TAFAT was founded on a simple belief. People deserve clear, honest, evidence-based informa) Tj T* (tion before spending their money. Every guide we publish is developed from authoritative h) Tj T* (ealth guidance, peer-reviewed research, and transparent editorial standards. When evidence) Tj T* ( is strong, we say so. When evidence is uncertain, we 